---
export const prerender = false;
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MusicNav from '~/components/audio/MusicNav.astro';
import AudioFooter from '~/components/audio/AudioFooter.astro';
import ComparisonPlayer from '~/components/audio/ComparisonPlayer.astro';
import PersonalNameText from '~/components/PersonalNameText.astro';
import { loadMusicCatalog } from '~/lib/music-content';
import { audioOffers } from '~/lib/audio-intake';
import { audioPath, mainSitePath } from '~/lib/host-routing';
import '~/styles/music.css';
import '~/styles/music-hubs.css';
import '~/styles/service-pages.css';
const host = Astro.request.headers.get('host') ?? Astro.url.host;
const catalog = await loadMusicCatalog();
const example = catalog.examples.find(example => example.service === 'mastering');
const recording = example && catalog.recordings.find(track => track.id === example.recordingId);
const start = audioPath(host, '/start');
const anchors = {'vocal-mix':'two-track-vocals',mastering:'mastering',bundle:'mix-master',custom:'full-mix'};
---
<BaseLayout title="Audio services · Kazon" description="Two-track vocal mixing and mastering. Careful listening, purposeful choices and clear scope before booking.">
<div class="site-shell music-page services-page"><MusicNav />
<section class="services-hero"><header><h1>Your song.<br />My full attention.</h1><p>Careful listening. Purposeful choices.<br />Your vision at the center.</p><a class="site-button" href={start}>Start your song</a></header>
<div class="service-evidence"><div class="service-evidence-heading"><h2>Hear the difference.</h2><p>{recording ? `${recording.title} · Mastering example` : 'Selected audio work'}</p></div>{example && recording ? <ComparisonPlayer example={example} recording={recording} /> : <p class="service-no-example">Listening examples will appear here when they’re ready to share.</p>}<a class="more-audio" href={audioPath(host, '/portfolio')}>More audio work →</a>{recording && <details class="service-credits"><summary>Credits</summary><p>This comparison demonstrates mastering.</p>{recording.credits.map(credit => <p>{credit.role}: <PersonalNameText text={credit.name} />.</p>)}</details>}</div>
</section>
<section class="service-offers"><header><h2>Find the right fit.</h2><p>Introductory prices · USD / song</p></header>
{Object.entries(audioOffers).map(([key,offer]) => <details class:list={['service-offer',{'service-custom':key==='custom'}]} id={anchors[key as keyof typeof anchors]}><summary><h3>{key === 'custom' ? 'Full mixing, production & recording' : offer.name}</h3><p>{key === 'custom' ? 'Scope agreed after review.' : offer.description}</p><span>{offer.price ? `From $${offer.price}` : 'By inquiry'}</span><b aria-hidden="true">+</b></summary><div class="service-scope"><p>{offer.scope}</p>{(key==='vocal-mix'||key==='bundle') && <p>A stereo beat is already mixed. Individual instruments cannot be rebalanced separately. Extensive editing or additional tracks are quoted before work begins.</p>}<details><summary>What to send</summary><p>{offer.files} {offer.preparation}</p></details><a class="site-link" href={`${start}?service=${key}`}>Start with this service →</a></div></details>)}
</section>
<section id="before-we-start" class="service-before"><h2>Before we start.</h2><div><p class="service-before-intro">Communication is async. Most projects start with a written brief and files shared through Drive, Dropbox or WeTransfer. I check every mix on multiple reference systems before it goes out. If a project is outside what I do well, I’ll say so and point you to someone who can.</p><details><summary>Revisions, delivery & payment <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>A revision round is one consolidated set of notes within our agreed direction. Every project includes two rounds. After the second, you approve the mix or stop the project; stopping ends it without final files, and the booking payment is not refunded.</p><p>Your first listening version arrives in 3–5 business days after usable files and booking payment. Availability is confirmed first; custom work follows its agreed timeline.</p><p>50% to book after file review and your approval of the offer. You pay through a secure Stripe invoice. Balance before final files. Additional scope is quoted for approval; delivery errors do not consume revisions.</p><p>Your files are for project review and agreed work. Portfolio use requires separate permission. Any remaining booking terms are supplied with your offer before payment.</p></details><div class="service-bottom"><p>We agree on the work and price before you book.</p><a class="site-button" href={start}>Start your song</a></div></div></section>
<p class="other-services">Need software or a website? <a href={mainSitePath(host, '/services')}>Work with me →</a></p>
</div><AudioFooter slot="footer" />
<script>
import { setupMusicPlayback } from '~/scripts/music-playback'; import { setupComparisonPlayers } from '~/scripts/comparison-player'; setupMusicPlayback(); setupComparisonPlayers();
function openService(){const target = document.getElementById(location.hash.slice(1));if(target instanceof HTMLDetailsElement)target.open=true;}openService();window.addEventListener('hashchange',openService);
</script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.more-audio{display:block;width:fit-content;margin:.6rem 0 .3rem auto;color:var(--accent);font-size:.9rem}.service-credits{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:right}.service-credits p{text-align:left;padding:.75rem 0}.service-credits summary{cursor:pointer}.service-offer summary>span{font-size:1.25rem;white-space:nowrap}.service-scope{max-width:70ch;margin-left:1rem;padding:.5rem 0 1.5rem;line-height:1.6}.service-scope p+p{margin-top:.75rem}.service-scope>details{margin:.7rem 0}.service-scope summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent)}.service-custom h3,.service-custom summary>span{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem}.service-no-example{padding:2rem 0;color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:650px){.service-offer summary>span{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;font-size:1rem}.service-scope{margin-left:0}}
</style>
